  "question": {
    "text": "Arrange the following elements in the increasing order of number of unpaired electrons in it.\n(A) \\(\\mathrm{Sc}\\)\n(B) \\(\\mathrm{Cr}\\)\n(C) \\(\\mathrm{V}\\)\n(D) \\(\\mathrm{Ti}\\)\n(E) Mn\nChoose the correct answer from the options given below :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\\((\\mathrm{A})  < (\\mathrm{D}) < (\\mathrm{C}) < (\\mathrm{B}) < (\\mathrm{E})\\)",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\\((\\mathrm{C})  < (\\mathrm{E}) < (\\mathrm{B}) < (\\mathrm{A}) < (\\mathrm{D})\\)",
